WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.550
Jesus is asked which
commandment is the greatest.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.170
He answers with the Shema,
words from Deuteronomy:

3
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:11.410
Hear, Israel, the Lord
our God, the Lord is one.

4
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:16.840
In the Qur'an, Muslims read:
Say: He is Allah, the One.

5
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:21.450
Christians, Muslims and Jews
all honour one Creator God.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.170
So why do they disagree about Jesus?

7
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.360
In this mission, you'll compare what
Christians and Muslims believe about who

8
00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.600
Jesus is.

9
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.070
Then you'll explore the
Messiah: what the title means,

10
00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.570
and who uses it.

11
00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:40.190
Your mission: find out why three faiths
that honour one Creator God disagree about

12
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:40.990
Jesus.
